# Uncork wine-macos-build patch 0002 — add missing distversion.h
#
# WHY: CrossOver's Wine source references include/distversion.h (via winedbg's
# resource.h) but CodeWeavers never ships the file, so `configure`/makedep aborts
# with "distversion.h: No such file or directory". winedbg's Makefile.in uses
# EXTRAINCL = -I$(top_srcdir)/.. so the file must exist at BOTH:
#   - <wine-source>/include/distversion.h
#   - <wine-source>/../distversion.h   (the sources/ dir one level up)
#
# ACTION: create both files with this content (verbatim):
#
#   #define WINDEBUG_WHAT_HAPPENED_MESSAGE "An application error occurred."
#   #define WINDEBUG_USER_SUGGESTION_MESSAGE "Please report this problem."
#
# APPLIES TO: CrossOver-sourced Wine (24.x / 26.x). Not needed for upstream Wine.
